  "_fingerprint_note": "Hashes pin every relationship (endpoints, type, confidence, reason) and every decline (reason/detail, file, name, position). Production fixes passed the original baseline unchanged before the geometric sweep and fixed-width nested formatting were introduced. Formatting changes the nested position fingerprints; each function still must match the independently computed target multiset.",
